slides.content:
## Define reusable template snippets

```go
{{/*
Expand the name of the chart.
*/}}
{{- define "mychart.name" -}}
{{- default .Chart.Name .Values.nameOverride | trunc 63 | trimSuffix "-" }}
{{- end }}
```

Use `{{ include "mychart.name" . }}` in your templates. This reduces duplication and enforces naming conventions.
